   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual Output Results</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Physical Security and Stockpile Management capacity of the Albanian State Police Increased to prevent the illicit diversion of SALW and ammunition.</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased Albanian State Police accountability and oversight capabilities in stockpile management  will be achieved by targeting specific areas of stockpile management to strengthen inventory management and increase stockpile physical security and safety through cost-effective and impactful improvements</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2022">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">Limited Physical Security and Stockpile Management capacity of the Albanian State Police.</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2023-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2023-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Introduction of a barcode system for weapons recordkeeping at the Ministry of Interior (MoI)/ASP central SALW and ammunition storage location Mullet. 

Security upgrade and equipping selected ASP priority SALW/evidence safekeeping room locations.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Introduction of a barcode system for weapons recordkeeping at the Ministry of Interior (MoI)/ASP central SALW and ammunition storage location Mullet
 
Security upgrade and equipping selected ASP priority SALW/evidence safekeeping room locations</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safety and Security enhanced through regional cooperation on SALW control in stockpile management, marking, tracing, and registration of weapons; knowledge sharing and standardization; and awareness raising (EUSAC project)</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancement of SALW Control Security Measures in Albania
&#xf0b7; Technical assessments of up to 8 ASP evidence rooms locations in Albania conducted, and scopes of upgrade works prepared.
&#xf0b7; designs for up to 18 evidence rooms&#x2019; locations and construction of one location procured, prepared and beneficiary endorsement obtained.
&#xf0b7; Works procurements for upgrade of up to 18 locations and construction of one location prepared.
&#xf0b7; Barcode module for weapons recordkeeping at MoI/ASP central SALW and ammunition storage location &#x201c;Mullet&#x201d; developed, and implementation initiated.
&#xf0b7; Technical specifications for the procurement of IT supplies for &#x201c;Mullet&#x201d; prepared and beneficiary endorsement obtained.
&#xf0b7; Overhaul of the Arms Management System (SIMA) planned and beneficiary endorsement obtained.
&#xf0b7; IT expertise for SIMA modules development procured.</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2022">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">Limited capacities for stockpile management, marking, tracing, and registration of weapons; knowledge sharing and standardization; and awareness raising (EUSAC project)</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2024-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2024-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased capacities for stockpile management, marking, tracing, and registration of weapons; knowledge sharing and standardization; and awareness raising (EUSAC project)</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased capacities for stockpile management, marking, tracing, and registration of weapons; knowledge sharing and standardization; and awareness raising (EUSAC project)</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
